<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>MMUN v2.0 — Release Notes</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
 @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Elsie+Swash+Caps:wght@400;900&family=Rubik+Moonrocks&family=Shadows+Into+Light&family=Special+Elite&display=swap');
  :root {
    --green-d:   #14532d;
    --green-m:   #15803d;
    --green-l:   #4ade80;
    --purple-d:  #4a1d96;
    --purple-m:  #7c3aed;
    --purple-l:  #e9d5ff;
    --pink-d:    #831843;
    --pink-m:    #be185d;
    --pink-l:    #fbcfe8;
    --badge-bg:  rgba(4,33,10,0.51);
    --body-bg:   #f0eeff;
    --ink:       #1a1a2e;
    --muted:     #888;
    --border:    rgba(124,58,237,0.13);
    --icon-border: #7f4ab4;
    --scroll-thumb: #e0d0f0;
    --card-bg:   rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
    --yr-bg:     rgba(10,54,4,0.16);
    --yr-border: #072d04d2;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;
    background: var(--body-bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* same mesh palette as modal header */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: -2;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 65% 45% at 0% 0%,   rgba(20,83,45,0.22) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 100% 5%,  rgba(74,29,150,0.20) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 55% 100%, rgba(131,24,67,0.18) 0%, transparent 55%),
      #f0eeff;
  }
  body::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: -1;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.75' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.025'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    background-size: 200px; pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* exact same keyframes as modal */
  @keyframes gradientShift {
    0%   { background-position: 0% 0%; }
    50%  { background-position: 100% 300%; }
    100% { background-position: 300% 300%; }
  }
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%,100% { opacity: 1; }
    50%      { opacity: 0.35; }
  }

  /* ════════════ NAV ════════════ */
  nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 36px; height: 60px;
    background: rgba(240,238,255,0.78);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav-logo-wrap {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-logo-img {
    width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover;
  }
  .nav-logo-text {
    font-family: 'arial', serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .nav-logo-text span { color: var(--purple-m); }

  /* same badge as modal #yp-version-badge */
  .nav-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg,green,rgb(1, 45, 1));
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    border-radius: 100px; padding: 5px 12px 5px 7px;
  }
  .nav-badge .dot {
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: cyan; box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--green-l);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  .nav-badge .txt {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .nav-back {
    font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(3, 56, 3);
    text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .nav-back:hover { color: var(--purple-m); }

  /* ════════════ HERO BAR — mirrors modal #yp-top-bar ════════════ */
  .hero-bar {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-d) 0%, var(--purple-d) 60%, var(--pink-d) 100%);
    background-size: 300% 300%;
    animation: gradientShift 15s ease infinite;
    padding: 60px 36px 52px;
    text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-bar::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      -55deg, transparent, transparent 60px,
      rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 60px, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 61px
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  /* same version badge */
  .hero-kicker {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    background: rgb(1, 53, 1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    border-radius: 100px; padding: 4px 12px 4px 7px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease both;
  }
  .hero-kicker .dot {
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green-l); box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--green-l);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  .hero-kicker span {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  /* same Instrument Serif italic h2 as modal */
  .hero-bar h1 {
    font-family: 'Rubik Moonrocks', serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg,white,red,white,green,cyan,white);
    text-shadow: 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.142);
    background-clip: text;
    font-style: italic; font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 62px);
    color: transparent;
    animation: fadeUp 0.45s 0.05s ease both;
  }
  .hero-bar p {
    font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    max-width: 440px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7;
    animation: fadeUp 0.45s 0.1s ease both;
  }

  /* ════════════ STAT STRIP ════════════ */
  .stat-strip {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.52);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .stat-item {
    flex: 1; min-width: 110px;
    padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .stat-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Rubik Moonrocks', serif;
    font-style: italic; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-m), var(--purple-m), var(--pink-m));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .stat-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ════════════ LAYOUT ════════════ */
  .page-body {
    max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 80px;
  }
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease;
  }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .section { margin-bottom: 60px; }

  /* ── Section header — mirrors .yp-change-item layout ── */
  .sec-head {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  /* mirrors .yp-change-icon exactly */
  .sec-icon {
    width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid #2563eb;
  }
  .sec-tag {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: darkblue; margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .sec-title {
    font-family: 'Special Elite', serif;
    font-style: italic; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400;
    color: darkgreen; line-height: 1.2;
  }

  /* ── Cards — match modal card aesthetic ── */
  .card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 22px;
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(74,29,150,0.1);
    border-color: rgba(124,58,237,0.24);
  }
  .card h3 { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 7px; }
  .card p  { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .card-detail {
    margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .card-wide { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .card-wide h3 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .card-wide p  { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .card-wide p + p { margin-top: 9px; }

  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }

  /* mirrors .yp-change-icon */
  .card-icon {
    width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 9px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 13px;
    border: 1px solid var(--icon-border);
  }

  /* ── Before / After ── */
  .ba-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .ba-box { border-radius: 10px; padding: 13px 15px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .ba-before { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.18); }
  .ba-after  { background: rgba(21,128,61,0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(21,128,61,0.2); }
  .ba-label  {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .ba-before .ba-label { color: #dc2626; }
  .ba-after  .ba-label { color: var(--green-m); }
  .ba-before p { color: #7f1d1d; font-weight: 300; }
  .ba-after  p { color: var(--green-d); font-weight: 300; }

  /* exact pill chips from modal */
  .chip-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .chip {
    padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 500;
    border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  }
  .chip-green  { background: #f0fdf4; color: #15803d; border-color: #bbf7d0; }
  .chip-purple { background: #faf5ff; color: var(--purple-m); border-color: var(--purple-l); }
  .chip-pink   { background: #fdf2f8; color: var(--pink-m); border-color: var(--pink-l); }

  /* ── Timeline ── */
  .timeline { list-style: none; }
  .tl-item {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 30px 1fr; gap: 13px;
    padding: 13px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .tl-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  /* mirrors .yp-change-icon */
  .tl-dot {
    width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--icon-border);
  }
  .tl-body h4 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .tl-body p  { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }

  /* ── Coming soon ── */
  .coming-card {
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 22px;
    display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.52);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(127,74,180,0.35);
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .coming-card:hover { border-color: var(--icon-border); }
  .coming-icon { font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
  .coming-tag {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--pink-m); margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .coming-card h3 { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .coming-card p  { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }

  /* ── Divider label ── */
  .divider-label {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .divider-label::before, .divider-label::after {
    content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border);
  }
  .divider-label span {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ── CTA — mirrors modal top-bar gradient + button styles ── */
  .cta-section { border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 60px; }
  .cta-top {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-d) 0%, var(--purple-d) 60%, var(--pink-d) 100%);
    background-size: 300% 300%;
    animation: gradientShift 15s ease infinite;
    padding: 44px 36px 40px;
    text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cta-top::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      -55deg, transparent, transparent 60px,
      rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 60px, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 61px
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cta-top h2 {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400;
    color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .cta-top p {
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    line-height: 1.7; max-width: 420px; margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }
  .cta-btns { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; position: relative; }

  /* mirrors yp-btn-primary exactly */
  .btn-primary {
    padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 12px; border: none;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-m), var(--purple-m));
    background-size: 100% 150%;
    animation: gradientShift 15s ease infinite;
    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: opacity 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.86; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-primary:active { transform: scale(0.98); }

  /* mirrors yp-btn-secondary exactly */
  .btn-secondary {
    padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 12px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center left, #072d04d2, transparent, #26034125);
    border: none;
    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block; transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { opacity: 0.8; }

  /* ── code inline ── */
  code {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px;
    background: rgba(74,29,150,0.07); border: 1px solid rgba(74,29,150,0.15);
    border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 5px; color: var(--purple-m);
  }

  /* ── Footer ── */
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 24px 36px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.42); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  footer p { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted); }
  .footer-chips { display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .f-chip {
    padding: 4px 11px; border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
    background: rgba(74,29,150,0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(127,74,180,0.2);
    color: var(--purple-m);
  }
  .index{
    color: white;
    font-family: calibri;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background-color: rgba(101, 3, 3, 0.568);
    padding:0 5px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  /* ── Scrollbar — same as modal ── */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--scroll-thumb); border-radius: 10px; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    nav { padding: 0 16px; }
    .hero-bar { padding: 40px 20px 36px; }
    .page-body { padding: 36px 16px 60px; background-color:#aff5c8;}
    .ba-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cta-top { padding: 32px 20px 28px; }
    footer { padding: 18px 16px; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .stat-item { padding: 14px 12px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ══ NAV ══ -->
<nav>
  <a href="/" class="nav-logo-wrap">
    <!-- Replace src with your logo URL -->
    <img
      src="/Assets/colorMMUNlogo.png"
      class="nav-logo-img"
    />
    <span class="nav-logo-text">MM<span>UN</span></span>
  </a>
  <div class="nav-badge">
    <span class="dot"></span>
    <span class="txt">v2.0 Rel-11 Live</span>
  </div>
  <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="nav-back">← Back</a>
</nav>

<!-- ══ HERO ══ -->
<div class="hero-bar">
  <div class="hero-kicker">
    <span class="dot"></span>
    <span>Release Notes · MMUN v2.0 Rel-11</span>
  </div>
  <h1>EVERY CHANGE,<br />EXPLAINED.</h1>
  <p>A full breakdown of everything shipped in MMUN v2.0 — what broke, what we fixed, what we improved, and why every decision was made.</p>
</div>

<!-- ══ STAT STRIP ══ -->
<div class="stat-strip">
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">7</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Changes shipped</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">3</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Bugs squashed</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-num">2</div>
    <div class="stat-label">New features</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-item">
    <div class="stat-item" style="color: gray;">00:00</div>
    <div class="stat-label">Wed/06/May/2026</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ PAGE BODY ══ -->
<div class="page-body">

  <!-- 1. MESSAGE STATUS DOTS -->
  <div class="section reveal" id="s1">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-icon" style="background:#eff6ff;">💬</div>
      <div>
        <div class="sec-tag">Feature · Messaging</div>
        <div class="sec-title"> <span class="index">1</span>  Message Status Indicators</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card card-wide">
      <h3>What changed</h3>
      <p>You can now see the delivery and read status of every message you send directly inside your conversation thread. Three new coloured indicators appear alongside sent messages: a <strong style="color:#2563eb;">blue dot</strong> means the recipient has read your message, a <strong style="color:#16a34a;">green dot</strong> means it was delivered but not yet read, and a <strong style="color:#d97706;">yellow dot</strong> means kyou have a new message.</p>
      <p>Indicators update in real-time via WebSocket — the moment the other person opens the conversation, the dot transitions instantly. No refresh needed, no guessing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:12px;">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#dbeafe;">🔵</div>
        <h3>Blue — Read</h3>
        <p>Recipient opened the conversation and viewed your message. Live WebSocket sync updates this the moment they read it.</p>
        <div class="card-detail">status: delivered + opened · real-time</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#dcfce7;">🟢</div>
        <h3>Green — Delivered, Unread</h3>
        <p>Message reached the device but conversation hasn't been opened. Transitions to blue automatically on open.</p>
        <div class="card-detail">status: delivered · pending read</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#fef9c3;">🟡</div>
        <h3>Yellow — New Message</h3>
        <p>Message has been sent by someone to you. Opened messages will show no dots on them since they're now seen.</p>
        <div class="card-detail">status: New-message · incoming delivered</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chip-row">
      <span class="chip chip-purple">Real-time</span>
      <span class="chip chip-green">All conversations</span>
      <span class="chip chip-pink">New feature</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. ACCOUNT CREATION FIX -->
  <div class="section reveal" id="s2">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-icon" style="background:#f0fdf4;">🙍‍♂️</div>
      <div>
        <div class="sec-tag">Bug Fix · Onboarding</div>
        <div class="sec-title"> <span class="index">2</span> Account Creation — Year Not Saving</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card card-wide">
      <h3>What was broken</h3>
      <p>During sign-up, users were asked to select their academic year (Year 1–6) or, for staff, enter their years of experience. A race condition in the form submission handler caused this value to be captured by the frontend but silently dropped before reaching the server — it was never saved to the user's profile.</p>
      <p>This created blank or placeholder year values across affected accounts, breaking filters, profile display, and matching logic. Any user affected will be prompted once inside the app to re-enter their year via the update modal.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ba-grid">
      <div class="ba-box ba-before">
        <div class="ba-label">Before</div>
        <p>Year selected at sign-up was silently dropped. Profile stored no year value. Filters showed wrong results. Users appeared as "Unknown Year" to others.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ba-box ba-after">
        <div class="ba-label">After</div>
        <p>Year correctly persisted on submission. Affected users prompted once via in-app modal. All filters now reflect accurate, verified data.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chip-row">
      <span class="chip chip-green">Bug fixed</span>
      <span class="chip chip-purple">Data integrity</span>
      <span class="chip chip-pink">All users</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. SCROLL ANIMATIONS -->
  <div class="section reveal" id="s3">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-icon" style="background:#fefce8;">⚡</div>
      <div>
        <div class="sec-tag">Performance · Animations</div>
        <div class="sec-title"> <span class="index">3</span> Smoother Scroll Effects</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#fefce8;">🖥</div>
        <h3>What was causing jank</h3>
        <p>Scroll animations ran on the main thread via <code>scroll</code> event listeners. On budget Android devices this caused frame drops and visible stutter — the browser had to recalculate layout mid-scroll on every frame. This followed the many scroll animations we had in the home page hero items e.g. logo, but now every animation is highly optimized to run smoothly without lag.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#f0fdf4;">🎯</div>
        <h3>The fix — GPU compositor</h3>
        <p>All animations now use only <code>transform</code> and <code>opacity</code> — properties the browser runs entirely on the GPU compositor layer, off the main thread. Zero layout recalculation during scroll. All scroll listeners we're also reduced to use only one listener for any event. The scroll overhead was also reduced by removing the logo rotation animation on every scroll. The scroll is now magnetic.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" style="background:#dcfce7;">📱</div>
        <h3>Low-end device focus</h3>
        <p>Tested on 2GB RAM / Snapdragon 4xx-class devices. Animations now consistently hit 60 fps, down from 24–35 fps before. Flagship devices are unaffected — this fix is purely targeted at mid-to-low-end hardware.</p>
        <div class="card-detail">target: 60 fps · tested: Snapdragon 4xx</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chip-row">
      <span class="chip chip-green">60 fps target</span>
      <span class="chip chip-purple">GPU compositor</span>
      <span class="chip chip-pink">Low-end Android</span>
    </div>
  </div>

